<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ScoreAnchor> logic:subClassOf [ a logic:Restriction ; logic:onProperty <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/anchorRangeMax> ; logic:allValuesFrom <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> ] .
